  "_comment": "REPLACEMENT for the legacy ScriptableObject dungeon 'FolksGranary' (2026-08-22, owner ruling: 'the last two break every time, so remove them and create two new ones'). The legacy asset pointed at Dungeon_FolksGranary.unity, which WO-776 gated out of play on 2026-07-30 as 'a contentless stub ... a real door into a hollow room'. Re-authored on the PROVEN composer pipeline: one floor, no stairwells, a spine with a dogleg (the dg_starter_loop turn pattern) plus two flanking rooms off the crossing. Slightly longer and meaner than dg_healers_cottage - orc raiders holding the grain floor, a mixed press in the loft corridor, and a warden in the keep.",
